<view class="page" wx:if="{{p}}"><view class="eyebrow">PLANT JOURNAL / 植物档案</view><view class="row"><view><view class="title">{{p.name}}</view></view><view class="plant-icon">{{p.icon}}</view></view><view class="section">植物介绍</view><view class="plant-introduction"><view class="body plant-overview">{{p.feature}}</view><view class="plant-facts"><view><text>学名</text><view class="scientific-name">{{p.latin}}</view></view><view><text>科</text><view>{{p.family}}</view></view><view><text>属</text><view>{{p.genus}}</view></view><view><text>其他常用名</text><view>{{p.commonNamesText}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{p.scientificSynonymsText}}"><text>旧学名 / 异名</text><view>{{p.scientificSynonymsText}}</view></view><view><text>档案层级</text><view>{{p.rank}}</view></view></view><view class="plant-care"><view><text>光照</text><view>{{p.light}}</view></view><view><text>浇水</text><view>{{p.water}}</view></view><view><text>环境</text><view>{{p.temp}}</view></view></view><view class="muted">养护资料：{{p.careStatus}}</view></view><button bindtap="save" class="save">{{saved ? '♥ 已收藏 · 点击取消' : '♡ 收藏这株植物'}}</button><view class="notice">{{p.rank}} · 证据范围：{{p.evidenceScope}}<view>{{p.reviewStatus}}</view></view><view class="section">先了解，对它的影响</view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="name">猫咪</text><text class="badge {{p.cat}}">{{labels[p.cat]}}</text></view><view class="body">{{p.catHarm}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="name">狗狗</text><text class="badge {{p.dog}}">{{labels[p.dog]}}</text></view><view class="body">{{p.dogHarm}}</view></view><view class="section">如何安心相处</view><view class="body">{{p.avoid}}</view><view class="notice">疑似误食应立即咨询兽医；移开植物，保留照片和接触时间记录。不要自行催吐、喂药或强行喂水。高危暴露不要等待症状出现。</view><view class="card"><view class="name">多了解一株，陪伴更安心。</view><view class="muted">读完介绍与猫狗风险后，把这份了解记下来。</view><button bindtap="learn" disabled="{{learned}}">{{learned ? '已记入成长册 ✓' : '已了解 · 记入成长册'}}</button></view><view class="section">铲屎官经验</view><view class="muted">交流养护与防护小妙招，也记录真实接触经历。经验因宠物、植物和环境而异，不能替代毒性依据。</view><view class="notice">本地体验版：仅保存在当前设备，不会公开给其他用户。社区共享将在接入账号、云端存储与内容审核后开放。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="writeExperience">{{writing ? '收起编辑' : '＋ 写下我的经验'}}</button><view class="card" wx:if="{{writing}}"><view class="muted">昵称（可不填）</view><input class="experience-input" placeholder="一位铲屎官" maxlength="20" value="{{nickname}}" data-field="nickname" bindinput="experienceInput"/><view class="row"><picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="categoryChange"><view class="chip">{{categories[categoryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><picker range="{{pets}}" value="{{petIndex}}" bindchange="petChange"><view class="chip">{{pets[petIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><textarea class="experience-textarea" placeholder="例如：我用带门的独立阳台养花，日常检查门锁和掉落的叶片。请写清环境、做法与观察，勿填写联系方式。" maxlength="1000" value="{{content}}" data-field="content" bindinput="experienceInput"/><view class="muted">{{content.length}} / 1000 · 至少10字</view><view class="notice">“我家吃了没事”不能证明无毒。请勿推荐试吃、自行催吐或用药；疑似误食应联系兽医。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{experienceError}}">{{experienceError}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submitExperience">保存我的经验（仅本机）</button></view><view class="chips"><text wx:for="{{experienceFilters}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{experienceFilter === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="filterExperiences">{{item}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!experiences.length}}" class="card muted">这里还没有{{experienceFilter === '全部' ? '' : experienceFilter}}记录。写下你的第一条实际体验吧。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{experiences}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view class="name">{{item.nickname}}</view><text class="badge">{{item.category}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.identityTitle}}" class="badge">{{item.identityTitle}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.pet}} · {{item.date}} · 仅本机</view><view class="body">{{item.content}}</view><view class="muted">个人经验 · 未经核实 · 不作为安全结论</view><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="deleteExperience">删除我的记录</button></view><view class="section">证据究竟支持到哪一级？</view><view class="card body"><view>证据对象：{{p.evidenceTaxon}}</view><view>适用范围：{{p.evidenceScope}}</view><view>核对日期：{{p.reviewedAt}}</view><view class="muted">{{p.reviewStatus}}</view></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{p.identityNote !== p.feature}}">{{p.identityNote}}</view><view class="muted">花色、花型和商品名不能单独证明毒性或安全。风险标签并非临床分级。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{p.sources}}" wx:key="url"><view class="body">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">依据对象：{{item.taxon}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.kind === 'toxicity' ? '毒性依据' : item.kind === 'taxonomy' ? '分类与特征依据' : '养护参考'}} · {{item.accessed}}</view><button data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="source">复制此来源链接</button></view><view class="section" wx:if="{{related.length}}">相近名称，分别核对</view><view class="card row" wx:for="{{related}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="latin">{{item.latin}} · {{item.rank}}</view></view><text>↗</text></view><view class="muted">“无毒”不代表可食用；手册不代替兽医诊断。没有物种或品种独立证据时，不虚构专属毒性剂量和严重程度。</view></view><view class="empty" wx:else>未找到植物，请返回重新搜索。</view>
